# Spield waitlist API — environment.
#
# Copy to `.env` for local work; set the same key in the Vercel project for the
# deployment.

# MongoDB connection string. Without it every route that touches storage answers
# 500 — the connection is cached across warm serverless invocations, so a bad
# value is retried on the next request rather than being cached as a failure.
#
# This is also the ONLY way to read the waitlist. The API deliberately exposes no
# route that returns signups (see the comment above `GET /activity` in index.js);
# read the `users` collection through Atlas or a Mongo client instead.
MONGO_URL=mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@<cluster>/<database>
